@startuml 低碳校园资源循环流转系统 - 核心时序图

title 时序图合集（3 张核心业务流程）

' ============================================================
' 时序图 1：发布闲置物品流程
' ============================================================
actor "用户" as User
participant "MainFrame" as MF
participant "ItemPublishPanel" as Panel
participant "ItemService" as Svc
participant "ItemDao" as Dao
participant "DatabaseManager" as DB
database "SQLite" as SQLite

== 用户发布闲置物品 ==

User -> MF : 点击"发布物品"菜单
MF -> Panel : 显示 ItemPublishPanel
Panel -> Panel : 填写物品信息\n(名称/分类/描述/价格/交易类型)
User -> Panel : 点击"提交发布"

Panel -> Svc : publishItem(userId, item)
activate Svc

Svc -> Svc : 校验参数非空
Svc -> Svc : 设置状态 ON_SALE\n设置 publishTime
Svc -> Dao : insert(item)
activate Dao

Dao -> DB : getConnection()
activate DB
DB --> Dao : Connection
Dao -> SQLite : INSERT INTO item
activate SQLite
SQLite --> Dao : 返回生成的 itemId
deactivate SQLite

Dao --> Svc : itemId
deactivate Dao
Svc --> Panel : Item(带 itemId)
deactivate Svc

Panel -> Panel : 显示"发布成功"弹窗
Panel -> MF : 返回物品列表
MF -> MF : 导航到 ItemListPanel

@enduml

' ============================================================
' 时序图 2：发起物品流转与完成流程
' ============================================================
@startuml 发起物品流转 -> 完成流程

actor "用户A(发起人)" as UserA
actor "用户B(发布人)" as UserB
participant "ItemListPanel" as List
participant "TransactionPanel" as Trans
participant "ItemService" as ItemSvc
participant "TransactionService" as TransSvc
participant "TransactionDao" as TransDao
participant "ItemDao" as ItemDao
database "SQLite" as DB

== 浏览与发起意向 ==
UserA -> List : 浏览物品列表
List -> List : 搜索/筛选
UserA -> List : 点击感兴趣的物品

UserA -> Trans : 点击"发起交换/购买意向"
Trans -> TransSvc : initiateTransaction(initiatorId, itemId)
activate TransSvc

TransSvc -> ItemDao : findById(itemId)
ItemDao -> DB : SELECT * FROM item WHERE item_id=?
DB --> ItemDao : Item
ItemDao --> TransSvc : Item

TransSvc -> TransSvc : 检查物品状态 ON_SALE
TransSvc -> ItemDao : updateStatus(itemId, RESERVED)
ItemDao -> DB : UPDATE item SET status='RESERVED'
DB --> ItemDao : ok

TransSvc -> TransDao : insert(TransactionRecord)
activate TransDao
TransDao -> DB : INSERT INTO transaction_record
DB --> TransDao : recordId
deactivate TransDao

TransSvc --> Trans : TransactionRecord(PENDING)
deactivate TransSvc

Trans -> Trans : 显示"已发起意向，等待对方确认"

== 用户B确认并完成流转 ==
UserB -> Trans : 看到待确认的流转记录
UserB -> TransSvc : confirmTransaction(recordId)
activate TransSvc
TransSvc -> TransDao : updateStatus(recordId, CONFIRMED)
TransDao -> DB : UPDATE ... SET status='CONFIRMED'
DB --> TransDao : ok
deactivate TransSvc

UserB -> TransSvc : completeTransaction(recordId)
activate TransSvc
TransSvc -> ItemDao : updateStatus(itemId, SOLD)
ItemDao -> DB : UPDATE item SET status='SOLD'

TransSvc -> TransDao : updateStatus(recordId, COMPLETED)
TransDao -> DB : UPDATE ... SET status='COMPLETED'\ncompleteTime=now()
DB --> TransDao : ok

TransSvc --> Trans : ok
deactivate TransSvc

Trans -> Trans : 双方都进入可评价状态

@enduml

' ============================================================
' 时序图 3：双向评价与信用分更新流程
' ============================================================
@startuml 双向评价与信用分更新

actor "用户A(评价方)" as Reviewer
participant "ReviewPanel" as Panel
participant "ReviewService" as Svc
participant "ReviewDao" as ReviewDao
participant "UserService" as UserSvc
participant "UserDao" as UserDao
database "SQLite" as DB

== 用户A提交评价 ==
Reviewer -> Panel : 进入评价界面
Panel -> Svc : submitReview(recordId, reviewerId, rating, comment)
activate Svc

Svc -> Svc : 校验 rating 在 1-5 之间
Svc -> ReviewDao : insert(Review)
activate ReviewDao
ReviewDao -> DB : INSERT INTO review
DB --> ReviewDao : reviewId
deactivate ReviewDao

' 找被评价方（对方）并更新信用分
Svc -> Svc : 确定被评价方 userId\n(从 transaction_record 获取对方)
Svc -> UserSvc : updateCreditScore(targetUserId, delta)
activate UserSvc

UserSvc -> UserDao : updateCreditScore(userId, delta)
activate UserDao
UserDao -> DB : UPDATE user SET credit_score = credit_score + delta\nWHERE user_id = ?
DB --> UserDao : ok
deactivate UserDao
deactivate UserSvc

Svc --> Panel : Review(带 reviewId)
deactivate Svc

Panel -> Panel : 显示"评价已提交"

== 用户B(对方)提交评价 ==
note right
  对方进入同样的流程
  同样更新信用分
end note

@enduml
